    "implementation_delta": "Publish SharedContractCatalog@1 as one normative source for the fourteen PCPR shared contracts. Each contract has one schema identity, canonical DAG-JSON bytes, unknown-field rejection, int64 limits, NFC Unicode, and CIDv1/base32/sha2-256 rules. Datasets and Kit bind those identities and refuse remint. Existing owner schemas remain bindings and are not reminted. This is not a freeze, not canonical-byte/CID vectors, not negative or cross-language vectors, and not cross-repository compatibility checks. Live supervisor and CUDA re-qualification stay typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
